{
  "productSlug": "webex",
  "shortDescription": "Cisco Webex is an enterprise unified-communications platform spanning meetings, team messaging, whiteboarding, Webex Calling cloud phone, and a separate Webex Contact Center line. A free meetings tier remains published; paid Meet and Suite seats are commonly cited around $12\u2013$14.50 and ~$22.50\u2013$27 per user/month respectively (medium confidence \u2014 webex.com/pricing renders dynamically by region/SKU). Enterprise agreements, Calling Professional add-ons, AI Assistant, devices and Contact Center are frequently quote-negotiated inside Cisco EA packaging. Scored as an enterprise UC / Webex Calling peer \u2014 not as a thin SMB virtual number and not as a pure CCaaS rank peer to Talkdesk/Genesys/Five9.",
